From: SL101 Tegra20 <sl101@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] grate: lower fragment SFU transcendental TGSI opcodes

Add LG2/SQRT and PREEX2/EX2, PRESIN/SIN, PRECOS/COS fragment
execution with scalar GPR source materialization and saturation.

---
